{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:55:42+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:55:42+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"UPM-Kymmene Oyj","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","country":"Finland","city":"Helsinki","website":"https://www.upm.com","employees":13665,"summary":"UPM-Kymmene Oyj, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the forest-based bioindustry worldwide. It operates through UPM Fibres, UPM Energy, UPM Adhesive Materials, UPM Specialty Papers, UPM Communication Papers, UPM Plywood, and Other Operations segments. The company offers softwood, birch, and eucalyptus pulp for tissue, specialty papers, packaging papers, graphic papers, and board; sawn timber for joinery, packaging, furniture, planning, and construction industries; and wood-based renewable diesel and renewable naphtha for transport and petrochemical industry. It also generates electricity through hydro, thermal, and nuclear power plants; provides financial portfolio management services, as well as engages in forestry water protection. Further, it provides plywood and veneer products for construction, vehicle flooring, liquefied natural gas shipbuilding, parquet manufacturing, and other industrial applications; wood and wood-based biomass, and forestry services for forest investors and owners; biomedical products, such as nano-fibrillar cellulose for clinical and life science applications; wood-based lignin products for industrial use; and wood-based biochemicals for replacing fossil-based raw materials. It serves distributors, industrial users, publishers, cataloguers, retailers, printing houses, merchants, converters, and label stock manufacturers; label printers; brand owners; and producers of tissue, board, specialty, and graphic paper. The company was founded in 1871 and is headquartered in Helsinki, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"UPM-Kymmene Oyj, en collaboration avec ses filiales, s'engage dans la bioindustrie forestière dans le monde entier. Elle opère à travers UPM Fibres, UPM Energy, UPM Adhesive Materials, UPM Specialty Papers, UPM Communication Papers, UPM Plywood, et d'autres secteurs d'activité. La société propose de la pâte de bois résineux, de bouleau et d'eucalyptus pour les tissus, les papiers spéciaux, les papiers d'emballage, les papiers graphiques et le carton; du bois scié pour les industries de la menuiserie, de l'emballage, du meuble, de la planification et de la construction; et du diesel renouvelable à base de bois et du naphta renouvelable pour le transport et l'industrie pétrochimique.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":12281376768,"shares_outstanding":527324046,"trailing_pe":19.905985,"forward_pe":12.670073,"price_to_book":1.2350851,"ev_to_ebitda":13.231,"ev_to_revenue":1.751,"dividend_yield":0.0612,"payout_ratio":1.2821001,"beta_yahoo":0.181},"targets":{"current_price":23.29,"mean":25.63214,"median":26.9,"high":30.0,"low":20.1,"n_analysts":14,"reco_mean":2.42857,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":0.28366,"eps_low":0.22,"eps_high":0.36,"revenue_avg":2339804990,"ex_dividend":"2026-10-29","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.02343,"institutions_pct":0.50181997,"institutions_float_pct":0.51386,"institutions_n":385,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":6449,"value":150197,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0301}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0143,"shares":7523415,"value":175220342,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0062},{"name":"SPDR INDEX SHARES Fd.S-State Street SPDR S&P Global Natural Resources ","pct":0.011,"shares":5788415,"value":134812190,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.1731},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0094,"shares":4976648,"val